  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e716824ef7498058ef85ded65bc7c36e7a81b66d_0.webp\" alt=\"Баннер\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmodpack%252felysium-days\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fyoncle/Elysium-Days/main/ed_badge.png\" alt=\"Как видно в Elysium Days\"></a></p>\n<p>Этот <strong>аддон</strong> добавляет поддержку модов к <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffresh-flower-pots\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Flower Pots</a>, чтобы ваш мир был согласованным и красивым!</p>\n<h1>Список совместимости</h1>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fregions-unexplored\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Regions Unexplored</a><br>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbushier-flowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bushier Flowers</a><br>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreeper-overhaul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Creeper Overhaul</a><br>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flets-do-meadow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] Meadow</a><br>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flets-do-herbalbrews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] HerbalBrews</a><br>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffriends-and-foes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Friends&Foes (Fabric/Quilt)</a><br>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flets-do-candlelight-farmcharm-compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] Candlelight - Farm&Charm</a><br>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdeeperdarker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deeper and Darker</a><br>\n<a href=\"/li